{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22025","main_id":22025,"main_title":"绝对独特的美食","main_description":"吃下奇怪食物的汤雯似乎食欲不振了起来...","chapter_title":"绝对独特的美食","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":2202501,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2202501,"sequence":15,"variant":0,"line_id":220250116,"next_line_ids":[],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3022,"speaker_text_hash":727626069,"speaker":"汤雯","speaker_raw":"汤雯","text_hash":2429897282,"text":"我记得…离岛的商人李晓对美食就很有研究，还有楚瑜商行的秋月，她也算是半个美食家了！","raw_text":"我记得…离岛的商人李晓对美食就很有研究，还有楚瑜商行的秋月，她也算是半个美食家了！","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2202501.json"}
