{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22025","main_id":22025,"main_title":"绝对独特的美食","main_description":"吃下奇怪食物的汤雯似乎食欲不振了起来...","chapter_title":"绝对独特的美食","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":1,"subquest_id":2202502,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2202502,"sequence":1,"variant":0,"line_id":220250207,"next_line_ids":[220250202],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3071,"speaker_text_hash":451384157,"speaker":"李晓","speaker_raw":"李晓","text_hash":2770101882,"text":"食欲不振...满嘴都是怪味...需要特别的美食才能拯救？","raw_text":"食欲不振...满嘴都是怪味...需要特别的美食才能拯救？","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2202502.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22025","main_id":22025,"main_title":"绝对独特的美食","main_description":"吃下奇怪食物的汤雯似乎食欲不振了起来...","chapter_title":"绝对独特的美食","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":1,"subquest_id":2202502,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2202502,"sequence":2,"variant":0,"line_id":220250202,"next_line_ids":[220250203],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3071,"speaker_text_hash":451384157,"speaker":"李晓","speaker_raw":"李晓","text_hash":105306786,"text":"居然遇到了这样的困难…确实有些棘手啊。","raw_text":"居然遇到了这样的困难…确实有些棘手啊。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2202502.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22025","main_id":22025,"main_title":"绝对独特的美食","main_description":"吃下奇怪食物的汤雯似乎食欲不振了起来...","chapter_title":"绝对独特的美食","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":1,"subquest_id":2202502,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2202502,"sequence":3,"variant":0,"line_id":220250203,"next_line_ids":[220250204],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3071,"speaker_text_hash":451384157,"speaker":"李晓","speaker_raw":"李晓","text_hash":247791298,"text":"不过依我看，倒不一定要特别名贵的菜，只要口感和风味独树一帜，再加上一些些的冲击力就足够了…","raw_text":"不过依我看，倒不一定要特别名贵的菜，只要口感和风味独树一帜，再加上一些些的冲击力就足够了…","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2202502.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22025","main_id":22025,"main_title":"绝对独特的美食","main_description":"吃下奇怪食物的汤雯似乎食欲不振了起来...","chapter_title":"绝对独特的美食","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":1,"subquest_id":2202502,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2202502,"sequence":4,"variant":0,"line_id":220250204,"next_line_ids":[220250205],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3071,"speaker_text_hash":451384157,"speaker":"李晓","speaker_raw":"李晓","text_hash":3872821074,"text":"所以我的建议是——绝云锅巴！既有独特的劲脆口感，又有猛烈的香辣力道…","raw_text":"所以我的建议是——绝云锅巴！既有独特的劲脆口感，又有猛烈的香辣力道…","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2202502.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22025","main_id":22025,"main_title":"绝对独特的美食","main_description":"吃下奇怪食物的汤雯似乎食欲不振了起来...","chapter_title":"绝对独特的美食","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":1,"subquest_id":2202502,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2202502,"sequence":5,"variant":0,"line_id":220250205,"next_line_ids":[220250206],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3071,"speaker_text_hash":451384157,"speaker":"李晓","speaker_raw":"李晓","text_hash":1243092602,"text":"从当年在轻策庄第一次尝到绝云锅巴，已经过去十几年了，到现在我还时常想起它...","raw_text":"从当年在轻策庄第一次尝到绝云锅巴，已经过去十几年了，到现在我还时常想起它...","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2202502.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22025","main_id":22025,"main_title":"绝对独特的美食","main_description":"吃下奇怪食物的汤雯似乎食欲不振了起来...","chapter_title":"绝对独特的美食","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":1,"subquest_id":2202502,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2202502,"sequence":6,"variant":0,"line_id":220250206,"next_line_ids":[],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3071,"speaker_text_hash":451384157,"speaker":"李晓","speaker_raw":"李晓","text_hash":2850656970,"text":"我想如果是绝云锅巴的话，无论什么问题都会迎刃而解的吧。","raw_text":"我想如果是绝云锅巴的话，无论什么问题都会迎刃而解的吧。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2202502.json"}
